---
const layers = [
  {
    n: '01',
    k: 'creative, component by component',
    d: "not just which ad wins — which parts of it do. hook, format, talent, angle, length, first three seconds. so the next brief is informed rather than guessed.",
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    k: 'funnel depth, not just platform reporting',
    d: "what's working top-line versus what's actually converting further down. platform-attributed roas and real contribution are different numbers, and i report both.",
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    k: 'revenue structure',
    d: 'which products, price points and cohorts the revenue is really coming from — so budget follows margin, not just volume.',
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    k: 'audience & placement splits',
    d: 'age, gender, platform, placement. the aggregate cpa hides the pockets that are carrying it and the ones bleeding it.',
  },
  {
    n: '05',
    k: 'speed of iteration',
    d: 'launch fast, kill fast, double and triple down faster. the edge is usually cycle time, not cleverness.',
  },
];
---

<div class="bd">
  <p class="bd-lead">
    i'm a <span class="hl">technical</span> performance marketer, not a general
    one. the advantage comes from resolution — seeing variables most teams
    never break out, and acting on them before anyone else does.
  </p>

  <ol class="bd-list">
    {layers.map((l) => (
      <li class="bd-item">
        <span class="bd-n">{l.n}</span>
        <div class="bd-copy">
          <div class="bd-k">{l.k}</div>
          <p class="bd-d">{l.d}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <p class="bd-foot">
    most of this runs through
    <a href="https://www.automated-ads.com" class="inline-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">automatedAds</a>
    — the tooling exists because the analysis came first.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .bd-lead {
    color: #b8b8b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .bd-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem 2.5rem;
  }
  .bd-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
  }
  .bd-n {
    color: var(--accent-deep);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .bd-k {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .bd-d {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bd-foot {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .bd-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .bd-lead { font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .bd-item:nth-child(n + 5) { display: none; }
    .bd-foot { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
